  "id": "dynamical/asos-parquet",
  "title": "Global Airport Weather GeoParquet (1940-present)",
  "description": "A global archive of decoded METAR surface weather observations from ASOS and AWOS airport weather stations, spanning 1940 to the present with roughly 1.8 billion records. Each record includes temperature, dewpoint, humidity, wind, precipitation, visibility, and pressure readings alongside the reporting station's point location, distributed as year-partitioned GeoParquet files.",
